From: OpenHarmony Compile Agent <agent@opendesk.local>
Date: Mon, 17 Jun 2026 11:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add .tarball-version for version detection

phodav uses git-version-gen script to detect version number.
In tarball releases (not git repository), this script expects
a .tarball-version file to exist with the version string.

Without this file, meson configure fails with version "UNKNOWN"
and project version validation errors.

This patch creates .tarball-version with "2.5" to fix the issue.
---
 .tarball-version | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
 create mode 100644 .tarball-version

diff --git a/.tarball-version b/.tarball-version
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..0fc6532
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.tarball-version
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+2.5
--
2.45.1